---
type: implementation
title: Disable workspace Work mode on Codex launch
status: testing-in-progress
---

# User request
Work on reportedly prevents Codex launch. Switch Work off when launching Codex. Exact launch failure cause is not yet reproduced; do not claim proven causality.

# Implementation
CodexLaunchAssembly CLI/app-server shared loader returns config with work_mode=false and persists via existing facade save_config callback. Other keys unchanged; already-off no write. Because Work is workspace-scoped this also changes Work for other sessions in the same workspace; not a Codex-private setting. No config is modified until a Codex launch loads it. Native desktop route still needs independent verification.

# Verification
20 focused Codex policy/configuration tests passed. Real Codex launch and installed verification pending; no live session terminated/restarted for testing.
